---
import Layout from '../../layouts/default.astro';

---
<Layout title="About | MECS" description="About ME Computer Services and our experience across Microsoft platforms, Linux, Docker, storage and small networks.">
  <main id="main-content">
    <section class="hero">
      <h1>About MECS</h1>
      <p class="tagline">Practical IT help. Clear fixed prices.</p>
    </section>

    <section class="about-content">
      <h2>One engineer, from enquiry to completion</h2>
      <p>ME Computer Services is an independent, one-person IT support business. You speak directly with the engineer who investigates your problem and explains the next steps.</p>
      <p>My experience covers Microsoft platforms from Windows desktop and Windows Server through to Hyper-V, Group Policy, Intune and Azure virtual machines and storage. I also work with Linux, Docker and Docker Compose, NAS storage, backups and small networks.</p>
      <p>The fixed-price packages cover focused checks and diagnosis. Larger Microsoft projects, including migrations, deployments and ongoing management, are assessed and quoted separately.</p>
      <p>Before work begins, we agree the scope, price and time allowance. Afterwards, you receive a plain-English summary of the findings, any approved actions and recommended next steps.</p>
    </section>

    <section class="values">
      <h2>What you can expect</h2>
      <div class="values-grid">
        <div class="value-item">
          <h3>Transparency</h3>
          <p>We provide clear, fixed prices before any work begins. No hidden fees or surprise charges.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="value-item">
          <h3>Practical Solutions</h3>
          <p>We focus on solving your actual problems, not selling unnecessary services or equipment.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="value-item">
          <h3>Clear Communication</h3>
          <p>We explain technical concepts in plain language and keep you informed throughout our engagement.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="value-item">
          <h3>Reliability</h3>
          <p>We show up on time, complete work as agreed, and stand behind our services.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="service-areas">
      <h2>Service Areas</h2>
      <p>Remote support is available by appointment. Local visits may be considered case by case when remote work is not suitable.</p>
    </section>
  </main>
</Layout>
